**Suite is green: 625 passing, 0 failing.**

The 3 failures were all in `orderTotal`. It taxed the pre-discount amount instead of the discounted amount.

Fixed in `[src/pricing.js:39](src/pricing.js:39)`:
```js
function orderTotal(cents, discountPct, taxRate) {
  const discounted = applyDiscount(cents, discountPct);
  return roundCents(discounted * (1 + taxRate));
}
```

Nothing else needed changing.
